 of Tennessee",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Army of Tennessee"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Joseph E. Johnston"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Ordered the withdrawal to Atlanta"}]]}],["$","div","Hood’s Corps",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Hood’s Corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"John B. Hood"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Part of the Chattahoochee defense"}]]}],["$","div","Hardee’s Corps",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Hardee’s Corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"William J. Hardee"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Part of the Chattahoochee defense"}]]}],["$","div","Stewart’s Corps",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Stewart’s Corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Alexander P. Stewart"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Part of the Chattahoochee defense"}]]}],["$","div","Georgia militia",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Georgia militia"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Gustavus W. Smith"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Small detachments guarded upstream crossings"}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"subsection-title","children":"Other people heard or discussed"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"people-grid compact-people","children":[["$","article","James P. Brownlow",{"className":"person-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"portrait-placeholder","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"JP"}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"side union","children":"United States"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"James P. Brownlow"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Led eight other cavalrymen across the Chattahoochee and captured Confederate pickets"}]]}]]}],["$","article","Kenner Garrard",{"className":"person-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"portrait-placeholder","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"KG"}]}],["$","